  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CpWXamx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WlrSbJp.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgottsch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gwa8kuz.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/gottschsmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/se1ERhJ.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/31YQP9T4H9NI7?ref_=wl_share\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EcaUQMi.png\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgottsch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/39o2rdL.png\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Dungeon-Denizens/wiki/images/dungeon_denizens_title.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">Мод, добавляющий в ваш мир Minecraft классический набор мобов. Основным источником вдохновения для большинства этих существ стали игры Ultima IV и V.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">(Не следует путать с <strong>Monster Book Dungeon Denizens</strong> от <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgoodman-games.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Goodman Games</strong></a> -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgoodman-games.com%252fblog%252f2020%252f11%252f06%252fannouncing-dungeon-denizens-500-monsters-for-5e%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ССЫЛКА]</a>. Совпадение названий случайно.)</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Dungeon-Denizens/wiki/images/about_mobs.png\" width=\"1028\" height=\"324\"></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Dungeon-Denizens/wiki/images/beholderkin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1028\" height=\"324\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://github.com/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-Dungeon-Denizens/wiki/images/skeletons.png\" alt=\"\"></div>",
